WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.773
Mom: I have to work today.

2
00:00:10.774 --> 00:00:13.678
Rachel: But it’s Saturday, Mom.

3
00:00:13.679 --> 00:00:19.231
Mom: It’s only once in a while.

4
00:00:19.232 --> 00:00:22.716
Ricky: Dad, you don’t look so well.

5
00:00:22.717 --> 00:00:27.695
Dad: No, I don’t feel good at

6
00:00:27.696 --> 00:00:31.535
all. Mom: You have a fever,

7
00:00:31.536 --> 00:00:35.100
dear. You need to get lots of rest.

8
00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:39.872
Ricky: Don’t worry. We’ll take care of Dad.

9
00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:43.096
Mom: Maybe I should stay home.

10
00:00:43.097 --> 00:00:58.509
Ricky: Dad is in good hands.

11
00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:04.480
Dad? Dad?

12
00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:07.981
Dad? Are you sleeping? Dad:

13
00:01:07.982 --> 00:01:11.423
I was sleeping, son.

14
00:01:11.424 --> 00:01:16.683
Ricky: If you need anything, just call me, okay?

15
00:01:16.684 --> 00:01:24.630
Dad: Okay.

16
00:01:24.631 --> 00:01:30.495
Ricky: Dad?

17
00:01:30.496 --> 00:01:36.238
Dad? Dad? Are you sleeping?

18
00:01:36.239 --> 00:01:43.732
Rachel: We brought you some tea and juice.

